# Find plugin on qed.ui: query, regex toggle, replace one and all.
file notes.txt
cat dog cat
the cat sat
catalog
end
run notes.txt
wait catalog
key ctrl+f
type cat
snap found
key down down
snap stepped
key esc
key ctrl+h
type cat
key tab
type lion
key enter
snap replaced
key alt+a
snap all
key esc
snap closed
